<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sulmo</span></b> , ōnis, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A town in the territory of the</i> Peligni, <i>near</i> Corfinium, <i>the birthplace
				of Ovid</i>, now <i>Sulmona</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquosus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 3, 15, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gelidus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. F.
					4, 81</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 9, 76</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 511</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 4,
				10, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 8, 4, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8,
			12</span></i>, A, 1; <i><span class="en">Flor. 3, 21, 28</span></i>.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sulmōnensis</span></b> ,
			e, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Sulmo</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 26, 41, § 250</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sulmōnenses</span></b> ,
			ĭum, m., <i>the
				inhabitants of Sulmo</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C.
				1, 18, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 12, 17, §
				106</span></i>.—<i>Sing. fem.</i>, <i><span class="en">Juv. 6,
			187</span></i> —* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sul-montīnus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of
			Sulmo</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colonia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Front. Colon. p. 145</span></i>
			 Goes.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A town of the</i> Volsci <i>in</i>
			Latium, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5, 9, § 68</span></i>; <i><span class="en">34, 14, 41, §
			145</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>The name of a hero</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 9,
				412</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 517</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
